                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I've translated this game to English and I'm playing through it now! I'm more than halfway done after spending over a month translating the text with multiple AI tools. I kept the tone dark and true to the original, doing my best to make sure everything makes sense (check the Steam Guides section, I posted the files there).\n\nAs for the game itself, only the prison section has unique maps; the rest of the locations are identical to Planet Alcatraz 1. However, there are far more items and many more random \"hunt\" missions where you can farm XP and loot across forests and deserts, fighting both human and beast enemies. The core gameplay mechanics are identical to the first game, but with extra layers added, such as stealing from restricted areas. The bugs honestly don't matter, the game is completely unique!",
